Cell["\<\
The displacement bundle of the grid has fibers with 4 vertices inside and 1 \
at the rim, so it has no connection:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"64903b57-65ee-4cf4-8aaf-61b6b0253e42"],

